ve agent task card\n\n    When: The agent is working\n\n    Then: Breathing/pulse animation plays on the card border, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n\n\n─── Notes ───\n[2026-03-05T01:30:03.199Z] @claude:\nSee plan @plan-ui-ux-revamp for implementation notes\n[2026-03-05T04:20:57.692Z] @claude:\nExecution context:\n- Background: Foundation design token layer that all other UI revamp tasks build on\n- Scope: Create lib/ds/ directory with tokens.css and animations.css; extend app.css @theme inline block with design-* tokens, status colors, spacing, z-index, typography; add shimmer and breathing animations gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n- Files: packages/web-ui/src/lib/ds/tokens.css, packages/web-ui/src/lib/ds/animations.css, packages/web-ui/src/app.css, tests for AC coverage\n- Verification: npm test in project root, vitest tests validating token presence and animation definitions\n[2026-03-05T04:31:57.761Z] @claude:\nImplementation complete. Created:\n- lib/ds/tokens.css: 16 oklch color tokens, 4 radii, 7 spacing, 7 z-index, 3 fonts, 7 status colors (light+dark)\n- lib/ds/animations.css: ds-shimmer (2s) and ds-breathe (3s) keyframes with prefers-reduced-motion gates\n- Updated app.css: imports tokens/animations, extends @theme inline with all design-* token mappings\n- tests/web-ui-design-system.test.ts: 18 tests covering all 4 ACs (reads built CSS output)\n- Build succeeds, all 18 new tests pass, full suite passes (2 pre-existing codex failures unrelated)\n[2026-03-05T04:41:04.671Z] Jacob Chapel:\nReview findings: MUST-FIX 1) Required test command fails in web-ui package: 'cd packages/web-ui && npm test' exits 1 because package script 'test' is missing (packages/web-ui/package.json). 2) kspec validate reports a warning for this spec that is a blocker per checklist: UI Design System status mismatch (spec implementation='in_progress' but validator expects 'not_started' based on task progress). AC annotation coverage exists for ac-1..ac-4 in tests/web-ui-design-system.test.ts.\n[2026-03-05T04:41:09.606Z] Jacob Chapel:\n```\n"}}]}}
